<title>USA: Berg Electronics completes buy of Ericsson unit.</title>
<headline>Berg Electronics completes buy of Ericsson unit.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berg Electronics Corp said Thursday it completed its previously announced acquisition of the connector division of Ericsson Telecom AB, a unit of LM Ericsson AB, for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>A new subsidiary, Berg Connectors Sweden AB in Katrincholm, Sweden, will continue to supply connectors to Ericsson for use in its switching and transmission systems, Berg said.</p>
<p>Berg is a manufacturer of connector, socket and cable assembly products with 1996 sales of about $700 million.</p>
<p>Its stock added 3/8 Thursday to close at 29-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
